Spectacled beta: Journals, Notes and Tasks for Android, iOS, Web and Desktop, synced over CalDAV with your own server. No account needed.
New in this beta:
• Fixed time zone shift for new journals and dates
• Mark done and Snooze right from task notifications
• Alarm notifications on iOS, Desktop and Web
• Faster, more reliable sync
• Right-to-left languages shown correctly
• Nicer About screen with release notes
